            </label>
            <label class="as-select-check">
              <input type="checkbox" data-sel-adj="invert" disabled />
              <span>Everything but the selection</span>
            </label>
          </details>
          <p class="as-inspector-note" data-select-note>
            These are the selections Alter really made of this photo — the same
            model, run on a Mac. Here the browser plays them back; in Alter it
            works on any photo, and the adjustment is a full brick.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul class="as-chips reveal" aria-label="What Select does">
        <li>Click to select <kbd>S</kbd></li>
        <li>Adjust only the selection</li>
        <li>Or everything but it</li>
        <li>Remove it — content-aware fill</li>
        <li>Refine with the Brush</li>
        <li>Detect Edges</li>
        <li>Runs on your Mac</li>
      </ul>
