    <!-- ── And more (CMS sections) ───────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="as-section as-more" id="more">
      <div class="as-intro reveal">
        <p class="as-eyebrow">And then some</p>
        <h2>Ten years of Mac you missed.</h2>
        <p class="as-lede">
          Alter didn’t start as an Aperture replacement — it started as a
          library for describing and publishing photos. So it also has a
          timeline editor, web layers, AI descriptions for photos and video,
          accessible web galleries, and posting with ALT text attached. All
          optional, all in the same library.
        </p>
